# Scoped to the snapshot tree so the shared root .gitignore stays untouched.
#
# Committed:   golden/*.png  — the baselines. Reviewing these IS the review.
#              stores.toml   — store geometry as data.
# Not:         everything below. All of it is regenerated by a failing run and
#              carries no information a rerun cannot recreate. Committing a
#              failure artifact would also make `git status` dirty on every red
#              build, which trains people to ignore it.

failures/*
!failures/.gitkeep

# Scratch trees the tests create and delete (never /tmp — a golden corpus that
# writes outside the repo is one `tmpreaper` away from an unexplained failure).
.scratch/
